{"version":1,"content":"<p>《903 AllStar籃球賽》將於11月7日（星期六）假亞洲國際博覽館ARENA舉行。</p><p>由叱咤903 DJ組成的「九零三人」將與「歌星勇士」籃球場上正面交鋒，展開連場激鬥。</p><p>為備戰正式賽事，一連三場「校園熱身賽」率先展開，DJ與歌手走訪不同中小學，與籃球校隊切磋球技，累積實戰經驗。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:01:23.005661+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T12:36:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.329778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:58:25.020297+00:00","content_hash":"94fa525c7424fd44da7d17b304ef1f7ec9bdc94c7e13242ea81a51bc3cf124b6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}